print this worktree's routed URLs

Usage:
  treerig urls [flags]

Flags:
      --config string   path to treerig.toml (default: nearest above cwd)
  -h, --help            help for urls
      --json            machine-readable output

Global Flags:
      --progress mode   how to show progress: auto (redraw on a terminal) or
                        plain (one line per change) (default "auto")
  -v, --verbose         show what treerig runs, and every detail
